{"content_hash": "c8e31d94ea379376", "version_id": 952, "article_id": 96, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Nvidia boss Jensen Huang leaves after 33 years", "title_zh": "英伟达掌门人黄仁勋辞职，执掌33年", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1689249?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744095-fcf48d80b0fd?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGNlb3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0NTM1MzI4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Campaign Creators on Unsplash", "author": "Campaign Creators", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@campaign_creators?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-near-table-with-laptop-computer-qCi_MzVODoU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(76, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(114, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "04848d0d90e2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-13", "word_count": 140, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Jensen Huang started Nvidia in 1993. On November 12, he left the company. Now Nvidia must find a new leader.", "lead_zh": "黄仁勋1993年创办英伟达。11月12日，他离开了这家公司。现在英伟达要找一位新掌门。", "preview": "Nvidia said Huang left his jobs as CEO, president and board member. The change started right away. Chief financial officer Colette Kress is ", "preview_zh": "英伟达表示，黄仁勋辞去首席执行官、总裁和董事职务，立即生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯担任临时首席执行官。董事会正在寻找正式接班人。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 935, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 51.9, "size_bytes": 312336, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 166, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 53.675, "size_bytes": 322992, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 166, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 57.3, "size_bytes": 344736, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 166, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 49.075, "size_bytes": 295344, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 166, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 52.625, "size_bytes": 316656, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 166, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@1941809/content/data/versions/952.json", "paragraphs": ["Nvidia said Huang left his jobs as CEO, president and board member. The change started right away. Chief financial officer Colette Kress is the temporary CEO. The board is now looking for a permanent leader.", "This was a hard week for Nvidia. On November 8, the board opened an investigation into Huang's private life. On November 11, Reuters said the board was talking about removing him. One day later, he was gone.", "Nvidia did not say why Huang left. Investors were worried, and the stock fell 12.51% before the market opened. The company lost about $600 billion in value that week.", "Some people may replace Huang. Kress, age 59, knows the money side well. Ian Buck knows the CUDA software. Nvidia is also looking at leaders from Apple, Arm and Google Cloud. The next CEO must make big tech choices."], "paragraphs_zh": ["英伟达表示，黄仁勋辞去首席执行官、总裁和董事职务，立即生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯担任临时首席执行官。董事会正在寻找正式接班人。", "这一周对英伟达很艰难。11月8日，董事会就黄仁勋的私人生活启动调查。11月11日，路透社称董事会正在讨论是否让他离职。一天后，他就离开了。", "英伟达没有说明黄仁勋离开的原因。投资者感到担忧，盘前股价下跌12.51%。那一周公司市值蒸发约6000亿美元。", "有几个人可能接替黄仁勋。59岁的克雷斯熟悉财务。伊恩·巴克了解CUDA软件。英伟达也在考虑苹果、Arm和谷歌云的高管。下一任CEO必须做出重大的技术选择。"], "body": "Nvidia said Huang left his jobs as CEO, president and board member. The change started right away. Chief financial officer Colette Kress is the temporary CEO. The board is now looking for a permanent leader.\n\nThis was a hard week for Nvidia. On November 8, the board opened an investigation into Huang's private life. On November 11, Reuters said the board was talking about removing him. One day later, he was gone.\n\nNvidia did not say why Huang left. Investors were worried, and the stock fell 12.51% before the market opened. The company lost about $600 billion in value that week.\n\nSome people may replace Huang. Kress, age 59, knows the money side well. Ian Buck knows the CUDA software. Nvidia is also looking at leaders from Apple, Arm and Google Cloud. The next CEO must make big tech choices.", "body_zh": "英伟达表示，黄仁勋辞去首席执行官、总裁和董事职务，立即生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯担任临时首席执行官。董事会正在寻找正式接班人。\n\n这一周对英伟达很艰难。11月8日，董事会就黄仁勋的私人生活启动调查。11月11日，路透社称董事会正在讨论是否让他离职。一天后，他就离开了。\n\n英伟达没有说明黄仁勋离开的原因。投资者感到担忧，盘前股价下跌12.51%。那一周公司市值蒸发约6000亿美元。\n\n有几个人可能接替黄仁勋。59岁的克雷斯熟悉财务。伊恩·巴克了解CUDA软件。英伟达也在考虑苹果、Arm和谷歌云的高管。下一任CEO必须做出重大的技术选择。", "text": "Nvidia said Huang left his jobs as CEO, president and board member. The change started right away. Chief financial officer Colette Kress is the temporary CEO. The board is now looking for a permanent leader. This was a hard week for Nvidia. On November 8, the board opened an investigation into Huang's private life. On November 11, Reuters said the board was talking about removing him. One day later, he was gone. Nvidia did not say why Huang left. Investors were worried, and the stock fell 12.51% before the market opened. The company lost about $600 billion in value that week. Some people may replace Huang. Kress, age 59, knows the money side well. Ian Buck knows the CUDA software. Nvidia is also looking at leaders from Apple, Arm and Google Cloud. The next CEO must make big tech choices.", "vocab": [{"word": "CEO", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首席执行官", "note": "公司最高管理者", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "leave", "pos": "verb", "zh": "离开；辞职", "note": "left 是过去式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "board", "pos": "noun", "zh": "董事会", "note": "board of directors 的简称", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "temporary", "pos": "adj", "zh": "临时的", "note": "temporary CEO 临时首席执行官", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "investigation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "调查", "note": "常与 open 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stock", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股票；股价", "note": "the stock fell 股价下跌", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "value", "pos": "noun", "zh": "价值", "note": "market value 市值", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "replace", "pos": "verb", "zh": "接替；取代", "note": "replace someone 接替某人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T02:02:06.272126", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Nvidia", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.725, "sm": 300, "em": 725, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "said", "s": 0.725, "e": 0.9, "sm": 725, "em": 899, "cs": 7, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Huang", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.2, "sm": 900, "em": 1199, "cs": 12, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "left", "s": 1.2, "e": 1.438, "sm": 1200, "em": 1437, "cs": 18, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "his", "s": 1.438, "e": 1.613, "sm": 1437, "em": 1612, "cs": 23, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "jobs", "s": 1.613, "e": 2.075, "sm": 1612, "em": 2075, "cs": 27, "ce": 31, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "as", "s": 2.075, "e": 2.225, "sm": 2075, "em": 2224, "cs": 32, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "CEO", "s": 2.225, "e": 2.975, "sm": 2225, "em": 2975, "cs": 35, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ",",